## Verification

TODO(content): how the system was tested before the team used it — UAT, test data, pilot (IN-05).

## Outcome

The system replaced a manual Excel compilation of over 3 hours per cycle and is now used regularly by the team.

## Reflection

Streamlit was a practical choice for rapid development, but more complex workflows may eventually need a different architecture; I'm exploring FastAPI and React as next steps. Sustainable improvement also needs time, clear priorities, and room for testing, refactoring, documentation and maintenance.
